          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nta nkeka uwo musi uraje, kandi uje waka nk’itanure. Abibona n’inkozi z’ibibi bazoba nk’ubwatsi bwumye, kandi uwo musi uje uzobatongora,” ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze. “Nta kimeze nk’umuzi canke ishami kizosigara kuri bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mwebwe muhindira agashitsi imbere y’izina ryanje, izuba ry’ubugororotsi rizobarasira, rifise ugukiza mu mishwarara yaryo. Maze muzosohoka mwishire mwizane, mutamba mwiginagura nk’uko inyana ziginagura iyo zisohowe ziva mu ruhongore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ku musi nzokorerako ivyo, muzohonyanga inkozi z’ibibi, babe nk’umukungugu musi y’ibirenge vyanyu,” ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
